# Icons & Visual Styling

## Lucide React Icons
- Use Lucide React icons consistently
- Import specific icons: `import { Facebook, Award, ExternalLink, Link as LinkIcon } from "lucide-react"`
- Use appropriate icon sizes: `h-4 w-4`, `h-6 w-6`
- Apply consistent styling with brand colors

## Icon Usage Patterns
```tsx
// Social media icons
<Facebook className="h-4 w-4 text-pink-500" />

// Award icons
<Award className="h-6 w-6 text-orange-400" />

// External link icons
<ExternalLink className="h-4 w-4 ml-1" />

// Generic link icons
<LinkIcon className="w-6 h-6 text-orange-400" />
```

## Visual Consistency
- Use consistent icon sizes throughout the site
- Apply brand colors to icons: `text-orange-400`, `text-pink-500`, `text-green-400`
- Use appropriate spacing with `ml-1`, `mr-2` for icon spacing
- Maintain visual hierarchy with different icon sizes

## Avoid
- Mixing different icon libraries
- Inconsistent icon sizing
- Icons without proper color theming
- Icons that don't match the brand aesthetic